50.d:
Ride of the Beholder, 2021
glsl on canvas

A generative series based on my original "ride [of the beholder]" piece as it first appeared on Hic et Nunc (may she rest in peace). H=N did not provide any hooks to generate images based on the transaction hash, so on that platform the object used the viewer's wallet address as its random seed. As such, each viewer saw a unique road ahead, personalized just for them, with no two alike.

On fx(hash), "ride" sheds its former solipsism. All paths are now visible. Which one will you take?

